    "raw_text": "Photo Contest\nThank you to everyone who submitted photos for this year’s Photo Contest! Your images highlight our district’s rich history, natural beauty and economic vitality. Thank you as well to all who took the time to vote for your favorites.\nWithout further delay, the winners are….\n1st place:\nGeorge K: “Columbia Wrightsville bridge at dusk moonrise” photo\n2nd place:\nGina F: “A classic journey through the woods” photo\n3rd place:\nAnastasia B: “Camp Security Park” photo\nYou can view the entire photo album here.\nNext year's photo contest is planned to open in the summer of 2027!\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
