      "summary": "A group of Republican state legislators held a press event at the Pennsylvania Capitol to promote House Bill 1849, which they introduced last month. The bill would require public schools and public colleges to label sports teams as male, female, or coed, and ban transgender girls and women from competing on female-designated teams. The press conference featured lawmakers, advocacy group representatives, and former student athletes as speakers.",
