    "url": "https://www.repjoed.com/News/38929/Press-Releases/Our-Office-Helped-Constituents-File-More-Than--70-000-in-Unclaimed-Property",
    "date": null,
    "raw_text": "Our Office Helped Constituents File More Than $70,000 in Unclaimed Property\nOctober 15, 2026\nOver the past 40 days, my office has identified more than $70,000 in unclaimed property belonging to constituents and businesses — including nonprofits in the 47th District. We’ve submitted claims to help return these funds to their rightful owners—many of whom were unaware this money was owed to them.\nDid you know the PA Treasury keeps track of unclaimed financial assets such as lost paychecks, unused bank accounts and more? Many times, this property goes unclaimed because of simple mistakes, like misspelled names or out-of-date home addresses.\nTo see if you or a relative have unclaimed property:\n•\nSubmit online at PATreasury.gov/Unclaimed-Property.\n•\nCall the Treasury at 800-222-2046.\n•\nCall my office at 717-840-4711 or use my website contact form for assistance.\nThis is money that already belongs to you — it’s time to get it back in your hands.\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
