      "summary": "A Pennsylvania state legislator's office assisted constituents in filing claims for over $70,000 in unclaimed property held by the PA Treasury over a 40-day period. The release also informs residents how to search for and claim their own unclaimed financial assets through the PA Treasury's existing program. Constituents can seek help through the Treasury directly or through the legislator's office.",
