    "raw_text": "Improving E Bike Laws and Safety in Pennsylvania\nOctober 26, 2026\nI recently hosted an e bike roundtable with local legislators and police departments to discuss the often-confusing laws surrounding e bikes, as well as safety concerns for both riders and the drivers and pedestrians around them. We explored what a new, streamlined, and more effective law could look like—one that is easier for constituents to understand and follow while improving safety around e bike use across Pennsylvania.\nSee a video of the roundtable discussion\nhere\nto learn more.\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
